@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #6E2635
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FAF7F3
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FAF7F3
skinparam roundcorner 10
title UML状态图  商品的九种状态
hide empty description
state "草稿" as Draft
state "待审核" as Pending
state "审核驳回" as Rejected
state "已发布" as Published
state "已预约" as Reserved
state "交易中" as Trading
state "已完成" as Completed
state "已下架" as Withdrawn
state "违规冻结" as Frozen
[*] --> Draft : 保存
Draft --> Pending : 提交审核
Pending --> Published : 审核通过
Pending --> Rejected : 驳回并记录原因
Rejected --> Pending : 修改并重新提交
Published --> Pending : 修改标题/分类/价格/主要描述\n[重审范围其余部分待确认]
Published --> Reserved : 成功预约\n[同一事务建立有效预约]
Reserved --> Published : 买家取消/卖家拒绝/超时关闭\n[同步终止有效预约]
Reserved --> Trading : 卖家确认
Trading --> Completed : 买家确认完成
Published --> Withdrawn : 卖家主动下架/管理员下架
Published --> Frozen : 管理员冻结
Reserved --> Frozen : 冻结并取消待确认预约\n[暂定规则]
Trading --> Frozen : 冻结并将预约转待管理员处理\n[暂定规则，需求前置条件存在冲突]
Completed --> [*]
note bottom of Trading
卖家标记已交付不改变商品状态。
买家提出争议时商品仍为交易中。
end note
note bottom of Frozen
冻结恢复、下架后的重新上架规则待确认，不绘制出口。
已预约与交易中不能由卖家修改价格或下架。
冻结与取消同时发生时，取消不得覆盖冻结为已发布。
end note
@enduml
